  "details": "Please add a whitelisted script or add functionality to at least allow UV manipulation for eye tracking, either directly or by driving UV maps via bones.\nAlso it would be nice if you could have the built in eyelid system work with animations instead of blendshapes or bones. (I have a shader that drives UV maps via an animated variable)\nThis would allow for certain flat eye handling methods that would both be less prone to clipping, and probably be more efficient to render.",
